        "wa’îđ qala îbrahimou rabi ajƐal hađa baladan aminan wârzouq ahlahou mina althamarati man amana minhoum biallahi wâlyawmi al’aķiri qala waman kafara fa’oumatiƐouhou qaliylan thouma aĎŤarouhou îla Ɛađabi alnari wabi’ça almaSiyrou",
