        "amana alraçoulou bima ounzila îlayhi min rabihi wâlmou’minouna kouloun amana biallahi wamala’ikatihi wakoutoubihi warouçoulihi la noufariqou bayna aĥadin min rouçoulihi waqalou çamiƐna wa’aŤaƐna ğoufranaka rabana wa’îlayka almaSiyrou",
