        "aynama takounou youdrikkoumou almawtou walaw kountoum fi bouroujin mouchayadatin wa’în touSibhoum ĥaçanatoun yaqoulou hađihi min Ɛindi allahi wa’în touSibhoum çayi’atoun yaqoulou hađihi min Ɛindika qoul kouloun min Ɛindi allahi famali ha’oula’i alqawmi la yakadouna yafqahouna ĥadiythan",
