        "wala taŤroudi alađiyna yadƐouna rabahoum bialğadati wâlƐachî youriydouna wajhahou ma Ɛalayka min ĥiçabihim min cha’in wama min ĥiçabika Ɛalayhim min cha’in fataŤroudahoum fatakouna mina alŽalimiyna",
