        "wama lakoum ala ta’koulou mima đoukira açmou allahi Ɛalayhi waqad faSala lakoum ma ĥarama Ɛalaykoum îla ma aĎŤourirtoum îlayhi wa’îna kathiyran layouĎilouna bi’ahwa’ihim biğayri Ɛilmin îna rabaka houwa aƐlamou bialmouƐtadiyna",
