        "wâktoub lana fi hađihi aldounya ĥaçanatan wafi al’aķirati îna houdna îlayka qala Ɛađabi ouSiybou bihi man acha’ou waraĥmati waçiƐat koula cha’in faça’aktoubouha lilađiyna yataqouna wayou’touna alzakata wâlađiyna houm bi’ayatina you’minouna",
