        "faķalafa min baƐdihim ķalfoun warithou alkitaba ya’ķouđouna ƐaraĎa hađa al’adna wayaqoulouna çayouğfarou lana wa’în ya’tihim ƐaraĎoun mithlouhou ya’ķouđouhou alam you’ķađ Ɛalayhim miythaqou alkitabi an la yaqoulou Ɛala allahi îla alĥaqa wadaraçou ma fiyhi wâldarou al’aķiratou ķayroun lilađiyna yataqouna afala taƐqilouna",
