        "wâlmou’minouna wâlmou’minatou baƐĎouhoum awliya’ou baƐĎin ya’mourouna bialmaƐroufi wayanhawna Ɛani almounkari wayouqiymouna alSalata wayou’touna alzakata wayouŤiyƐouna allaha waraçoulahou oula’ika çayarĥamouhoumou allahou îna allaha Ɛaziyzoun ĥakiymoun",
