        "fa’în rajaƐaka allahou îla Ťa’ifatin minhoum fâçta’đanouka lilķourouji faqoul lan taķroujou maƐia abadan walan touqatilou maƐia Ɛadouan înakoum raĎiytoum bialqouƐoudi awala maratin fâqƐoudou maƐa alķalifiyna",
