        "wama kana almou’minouna liyanfirou kafatan falawla nafara min kouli firqatin minhoum Ťa’ifatoun liyatafaqahou fi aldiyni waliyounđirou qawmahoum îđa rajaƐou îlayhim laƐalahoum yaĥđarouna",
