        "falawla kana mina alqourouni min qablikoum oulou baqiyatin yanhawna Ɛani alfaçadi fi al’arĎi îla qaliylan miman anjayna minhoum wâtabaƐa alađiyna Žalamou ma outrifou fiyhi wakanou moujrimiyna",
