        "wahouwa alađi çaķara albaĥra lita’koulou minhou laĥman Ťariyan wataçtaķrijou minhou ĥilyatan talbaçounaha watara alfoulka mawaķira fiyhi walitabtağou min faĎlihi walaƐalakoum tachkourouna",
