        "waliyaƐlama alađiyna outou alƐilma anahou alĥaqou min rabika fayou’minou bihi fatouķbita lahou qouloubouhoum wa’îna allaha lahadi alađiyna amanou îla SiraŤin mouçtaqiymin",
