        "wâlađiyna kafarou aƐmalouhoum kaçarabin biqiyƐatin yaĥçabouhou alŽam’anou ma’an ĥata îđa ja’ahou lam yajidhou chay’an wawajada allaha Ɛindahou fawafahou ĥiçabahou wâllahou çariyƐou alĥiçabi",
