        "ķalaqa alçamawati biğayri Ɛamadin tarawnaha wa’alqa fi al’arĎi rawaçia an tamiyda bikoum wabatha fiyha min kouli dabatin wa’anzalna mina alçama’i ma’an fa’anbatna fiyha min kouli zawjin kariymin",
