        "yaĥçabouna al’aĥzaba lam yađhabou wa’în ya’ti al’aĥzabou yawadou law anahoum badouna fi al’aƐrabi yaç’alouna Ɛan anba’ikoum walaw kanou fiykoum ma qatalou îla qaliylan",
